  "title": "2022 Colorado Car Accident Fatality Stats",
  "excerpt": "Motor vehicle accidents are a leading cause of unintentional injury death in the United States. An early estimate for 2022 from the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration states that 42,795 people died in motor vehicle traffic accidents nationwide. Fatal car accidents can happen when a family least expects it and cause immense emotional turmoil. Review […]",
