      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbcm",
          "text": "Colorado’s fatal car accident data for 2022 shows a concerning upward trend in the number of deadly car crashes in the state in recent years. If you have recently lost a loved one in a devastating fatal car accident in Denver, Colorado, please ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbco",
          "text": "contact Dormer Harpring, LLP",
          "marks": [
            "lbcn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbcp",
          "text": " to request a free case consultation. Our attorneys provide compassionate legal counsel to grieving families. You may be eligible for financial compensation.",
